# SEL then a black mute key (black 5-9): that track selected, nothing muted, SEL done; SEL held the same
wait 200
expect track 0
tap SEL
tapkey b6
expect track 2
expect tpar7 0
shot sel-track.png
press SEL
tapkey b8
release SEL
expect track 4
# without SEL the key mutes as before (track 1 muted, track 5 still selected)
tapkey b4
expect track 4
tap OCT+
expect track 0
expect tpar7 1
